" id=\"state\">-</span></div>\n    <div class=\"segs\" id=\"segs\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sub\"><span class=\"bank px\" id=\"bank\">-</span><span id=\"subText\">opens when full</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"act\">\n    <div class=\"safe\" title=\"the vault. grows every box. something opens it\">\n      <div class=\"door\"><div class=\"dial\"></div><div class=\"glint\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"txt\"><span class=\"k\">the vault</span><span class=\"v\" id=\"vault\">0 sol</span><span class=\"w\">something opens it</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"buy px\" id=\"buy\" href=\"https://x.com/Pullitbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">buy $pullit</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"mid\">\n  <section class=\"log\">\n    <div class=\"loghead\"><span class=\"px\">the keepers log</span><span><span class=\"live\">●</span> live</span></div>\n    <ol id=\"feed\"></ol>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"inside\">\n    <div class=\"h\"><h2 class=\"px\" id=\"insideTitle\">whats in box #1</h2><span class=\"note\" id=\"insideNote\">nobody knows. not even us</span></div>\n    <div class=\"oddsrow\" id=\"oddsrow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"belt\" id=\"belt\" title=\"tap for a practice pull\"><div class=\"glass\" id=\"glass\">\n      <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\"></div>\n      <div class=\"floor\"><div class=\"tread\"></div><div class=\"rollers\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"marker\"><span class=\"lbl\">your pull</span></div>\n      <span class=\"hint\">tap to try</span>\n      <div class=\"result\" id=\"result\"></div>\n    </div></div>\n    <form class=\"check\" id=\"check\">\n      <label for=\"wallet\" class=\"px\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\">your wallet</label>\n      <input id=\"wallet\" placeholder=\"paste your wallet, see your tickets\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\">\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px\">tickets</button>\n    </form>\n    <div class=\"answer on\" id=\"answer\">hold $20 for 15 min. thats your ticket</div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"opened\">\n  <span class=\"lbl px\">opened</span>\n  <div class=\"tape\" id=\"grid\"><span class=\"empty\" style=\"padding-left:14px\">nothing opened yet. the first box opens at 0.15 sol</span></div>\n  <span class=\"stats\"><b id=\"holders\">-</b> holders · <b id=\"eligible\">-</b> in the draw · <b id=\"given\">0</b> sol given</span>\n</section>\n\n\n</div>\n\n<dialog id=\"rules\"><div class=\"sheet\">\n  <h2 class=\"px\">rules<button class=\"x\" type=\"button\" data-close aria-label=\"close\">x</button></h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>trading fees fill the box. 80% goes in, 20% keeps the agent running and the team building. a tenth of what goes in is set aside in the vault. something opens the vault. you will see</li>\n    <li>when the box is full, an ai picks two coins: a fresh runner and a runner of the meta. it seals them. nobody sees them until the box opens</li>\n    <li>the box locks to a future solana block. that block picks the holder and the tier. nobody knows it in advance, us included</li>\n  </ul>\n  <table>\n    <tr><td class=\"t-common px\">common</td><td>50%</td><td>a slice of the box in a fresh runner</td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"t-rare px\">rare</td><td>30%</td><td>a bigger slice in a meta runner</td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"t-epic px\">epic</td><td>15%</td><td>???</td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"t-secret px\">secret</td><td>5%</td><td>???</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <ul>\n    <li>whatever a pull leaves in the box rolls into the next one</li>\n    <li>hold $20+ for 15 min and youre in. longer hold, more tickets, up to 3x at 24h. a bag counts up to 1% of supply, and no wallet gets more than 10% of all tickets</li>\n    <li>pools and our own wallets are never in the draw</li>\n    <li>if the box ever stops, everything left, vault included, goes out in a final box</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h3 class=\"px\">what the bot can do</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>claim fees, split them, buy the prize, send it to the winner. thats it</li>\n    <li>it has no code to sell $pullit and no way to send the box anywhere except a winner</li>\n  </ul>\n  <dl id=\"wallets\"></dl>\n  <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">not financial advice. a prize can be worth less than you think. its a box.</p>\n</div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"boxSheet\"><div class=\"sheet\" id=\"boxBody\"></div></dialog>\n\n<script>\nconst GITHUB = '';\nconst Q = location.search;\nconst $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\nconst TIERS = [\n  { key: 'common', pct: 50, what: 'fresh runners' },\n  { key: 'rare', pct: 30, what: 'meta runners' },\n  { key: 'epic', pct: 15, what: '' },\n  { key: 'secret', pct: 5, what: '' }\n];\nconst COLOR = { common: '#c9c2d6', rare: '#8ec5ff', epic: '#cfa8ff', secret: '#ffc94d' };\nconst TAG = { fee: '#7be0c3', scan: '#9a8f99', pick: '#8ec5ff', box: '#ff8dc0', draw: '#ffc94d', win: '#ff8dc0', sent: '#9a8f99', info: '#9a8f99', roast: '#ff6b6b', hold: '#7be0c3', x: '#f4eef2' };\nconst MSG = { x: 'hi', pick: 'hi', box: 'pk', win: 'pk', draw: 'gd', roast: 'rd', hold: 'mt' };\nconst capBg = (t) => `linear-gradient(180deg,${COLOR[t]} 50%,#f6eff9 50%)`;\nconst short = (a) => (a ? a.slice(0, 4) + '…' + a.slice(-4) : '-');\nconst sol = (l) => Number(l || 0) / 1e9;\nconst fmt = (n, d = 3) => { const s = n.toFixed(d); return s.includes('.') ? s.replace(/0+$/, '').replace(/\\.$/, '') : s; };\nconst acct = (a) => 'https://solscan.io/account/' + a;\nconst hhmm = (iso) => new Date(iso).toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hour12: false });\nconst ago = (iso) => { const m = Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - Date.parse(iso)) / 60000)); return m < 60 ? m + 'm' : m < 1440 ? Math.round(m / 60) + 'h' : Math.round(m / 1440) + 'd'; };\nconst el = (tag, props = {}, ...kids) => { const e = document.createElement(tag); Object.assign(e, props); e.append(...kids); return e; };\nconst api = (path, extra = '') => fetch(path + (Q ? Q + (extra ? '&' + extra : '') : extra ? '?' + extra : ''), { cache: 'no-store' }).then((r) => r.json());\nconst cap = (t, size) => el('span', { className: 'cap', style: `background:${capBg(t)};box-shadow:0 0 0 2px ${COLOR[t]}` + (size ? `;width:${size}px;height:${size}px` : '') });\n\nif (GITHUB) { $('gh').href = GITHUB; $('gh').hidden = false; }\nfor (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) $('segs').append(el('i'));\nTIERS.forEach((t) => $('oddsrow').append(el('div', { className: 'o ' + t.key, style: `--c:${COLOR[t.key]}`, title: t.what || '???' },\n  el('span', { className: 'nm', textContent: t.key }), el('span', { className: 'pc', textContent: t.pct + '%' }))));\n\nlet S = null, mint = '', said = '';\nfunction say(t) { if (t !== said) { said = t; $('say').textContent = t; } }\n\n$('ca').onclick = () => {\n  if (!mint) return;\n  navigator.clipboard.writeText(mint).then(() => { $('caText').textContent = 'copied'; setTimeout(() => ($('caText').textContent = short(mint)), 1200); });\n};\n\n// ---------- the belt: boxes ride past at the real odds; the block stops it ----------\nconst Belt = (() => {\n  const SIZE = { common: 40, rare: 52, epic: 64, secret: 78 };\n  const GAP = 14;\n  const glass = $('glass'), track = $('track'), beltEl = $('belt'), result = $('result');\n  const box = (tier, s) => {\n    const b = el('div', { className: 'gbox ' + tier, style: `--c:${COLOR[tier]};--s:calc(${s}px * var(--k, 1))` },\n      el('div', { className: 'bow' }), el('div', { className: 'lid' }),\n      el('div', { className: 'bod' }, el('span', { className: 'tag', textContent: '?' })), el('div', { className: 'sh' }));\n    b.dataset.tier = tier; return b;\n  };\n  // 50 boxes in exact proportion (30 / 14 / 5 / 1), shuffled, laid out twice\n  const deck = () => { const d = [...Array(30).fill('common'), ...Array(14).fill('rare'), ...Array(5).fill('epic'), 'secret'];\n    for (let i = d.length - 1; i > 0; i--) { const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1)); [d[i], d[j]] = [d[j], d[i]]; } return d; };\n  [...deck(), ...deck()].forEach((t) => track.append(box(t, SIZE[t])));\n\n  // boxes grow with the window, so a tall window is filled, not empty on top\n  const IDLE = 38, FAST = 420;\n  let x = 0, speed = IDLE, want = IDLE, last = performance.now(), stop = null, busy = false, onDone = null;\n  const width = (n) => n.getBoundingClientRect().width;\n  function frame(now) {\n    const dt = Math.min(0.05, (now - last) / 1000); last = now;\n    if (stop) {\n      const t = Math.min(1, (now - stop.t0) / stop.ms);\n      const e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 4);\n      x = stop.x0 - stop.dist * e;\n      if (t >= 1) { const s = stop; stop = null; speed = 0; want = 0; s.done(); }\n    } else {\n      speed += (want - speed) * Math.min(1, dt * 3);\n      x -= speed * dt;\n      // recycle boxes that left on the left\n      let first = track.firstElementChild;\n      while (first && -x > width(first) + GAP) { x += width(first) + GAP; track.append(first); first = track.firstElementChild; }\n    }\n    track.style.transform = `translateX(${x}px)`;\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n\n  function stopOn(tier, done) {\n    const mid = glass.getBoundingClientRect().left + glass.clientWidth / 2;\n    const v = Math.max(speed, 80);\n    const minAhead = v * 2.4 / 4;\n    let target = null, dist = 0;\n    for (const n of track.children) {\n      const r = n.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const c = r.left + r.width / 2 - mid;\n      if (c > minAhead && n.dataset.tier === tier) { target = n; dist = c; break; }\n    }\n    if (!target) { done(null); return; }\n    stop = { x0: x, dist, t0: performance.now(), ms: Math.max(2400, Math.min(4800, (4 * dist / v) * 1000)), done: () => done(target) };\n  }\n  function reveal(target, html, ms, label) {\n    [...track.children].forEach((n) => n !== target && n.classList.add('dim'));\n    target.classList.add('open');\n    const extras = [el('span', { className: 'pop', textContent: label || '?' })];\n    const n = { common: 10, rare: 16, epic: 24, secret: 40 }[target.dataset.tier];\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      const a = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2, d = 40 + Math.random() * 70;\n      extras.push(el('i', { className: 'bit', style: `--dx:${Math.cos(a) * d}px;--dy:${Math.sin(a) * d - 20}px;animation-delay:${Math.random() * 0.15}s;background:${Math.random() < 0.3 ? '#f6eff9' : 'var(--c)'}` }));\n    }\n    target.append(...extras);\n    result.replaceChildren(...html); result.classList.add('show');\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      result.classList.remove('show'); target.classList.remove('open');\n      extras.forEach((e) => e.remove());\n      [...track.children].forEach((n) => n.classList.remove('dim'));\n      busy = false; want = IDLE; beltEl.classList.remove('rolling'); if (onDone) onDone();\n    }, ms);\n  }\n  return {\n    get busy() { return busy; },\n    rolling(on) { if (busy && !on) return; beltEl.classList.toggle('rolling', on); want = on ? FAST : IDLE; },\n    land(tier, html, ms = 9000, label, cb) {\n      busy = true; onDone = cb; want = FAST; beltEl.classList.add('rolling');\n      setTimeout(() => stopOn(tier, (target) => { if (!target) { busy = false; want = IDLE; return; } reveal(target, html, ms, label); }), 900);\n    },\n  };\n})();\n\n// tap the belt for a practice pull at the real odds\nconst PRACTICE = {\n  common: 'common. a fresh runner. could be the next one, could be dust',\n  rare: 'rare. a meta runner. the boring adult choice',\n  epic: 'epic. you will find out what that means when it happens for real',\n  secret: 'secret. 1 in 50. screenshot it, it was fake',\n};\n$('belt').onclick = () => {\n  if (Belt.busy || (S && S.pending)) return;\n  const r = Math.random() * 100;\n  const t = r < 50 ? 'common' : r < 80 ? 'rare' : r < 95 ? 'epic' : 'secret';\n  Belt.land(t, [el('b', { className: 't-' + t, textContent: 'practice: ' }), PRACTICE[t]], 5000, t === 'common' || t === 'rare' ? '$???' : '???');\n};\n\nfunction renderInside(id, packed) {\n  $('insideTitle').textContent = 'whats in box #' + id;\n  $('insideNote').textContent = packed ? 'sealed ' + short(packed.seal) : 'nobody knows. not even us';\n  Belt.rolling(!!packed);\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  const s = S; if (!s) return;\n  const p = s.pub || {};\n  if (p.mint && p.mint !== mint) { mint = p.mint; $('caText').textContent = short(mint); $('buy').href = 'https://pump.fun/coin/' + mint; }\n  $('testBar').hidden = !s.dry;\n  const pk = s.pending;\n  const id = pk ? pk.boxId : s.nextBoxId || 1;\n  $('boxTitle').textContent = s.phase === 'done' ? 'all done' : 'box #' + id;\n  const have = sol(p.boxLamports), need = sol(p.thresholdLamports);\n  const pct = pk ? 1 : need ? Math.min(1, have / need) : 0;\n  const on = Math.floor(pct * 20);\n  $('segs').classList.toggle('packed', !!pk);\n  [...$('segs').children].forEach((c, i) => { c.className = pk ? '' : i < on ? 'on' : i === on ? 'now' : ''; });\n  $('boxwin').classList.toggle('packed', !!pk);\n  $('vault').textContent = fmt(sol(s.vaultLamports), 2) + ' sol';\n  $('holders').textContent = (p.holders ?? '-').toLocaleString?.() ?? '-';\n  $('eligible').textContent = (p.eligible ?? '-').toLocaleString?.() ?? '-';\n  $('given').textContent = fmt(sol(s.givenLamports), 2);\n  renderInside(id, pk);\n\n  const st = $('state'); st.classList.toggle('packed', !!pk);\n  const last = s.history && s.history[0];\n  if (render.seen === undefined) render.seen = last ? last.boxId : 0;\n  else if (last && last.boxId > render.seen) {\n    render.seen = last.boxId;\n    const t = last.draw.tier;\n    Belt.land(t, [el('b', { className: 't-' + t, textContent: t + ' ' }), `${short(last.draw.winner)} · ${fmt(sol(last.prize?.lamports), 3)} sol of $${last.prize?.symbol || '?'}`], 12000, '$' + (last.prize?.symbol || '?'));\n  }\n  if (!mint) { st.textContent = 'soon'; $('bank').textContent = '-'; $('subText').textContent = 'not live yet'; say('not live yet. soon'); }\n  else if (s.phase === 'done') { st.textContent = 'closed'; $('bank').textContent = 'empty'; $('subText').textContent = 'the final box is open'; say('that was the final box. thanks for holding me'); }\n  else if (pk) {\n    const left = Math.round(70 - (Date.now() - Date.parse(pk.at)) / 1000);\n    st.textContent = left > 0 ? `opens in ~${left}s` : 'opening…';\n    $('bank').textContent = fmt(sol(pk.budgetLamports)) + ' sol inside';\n    $('subText').textContent = 'block ' + pk.targetSlot.toLocaleString('en-US') + ' picks the holder';\n    say(pk.posts?.[0] || 'packed and sealed. even i cant peek');\n  } else {\n    st.textContent = 'filling';\n    $('bank').textContent = need ? `${fmt(have)} / ${fmt(need, 2)} sol` : '-';\n    $('subText').textContent = 'opens when full';\n    const fresh = last && Date.now() - Date.parse(last.at) < 10 * 60_000;\n    if (fresh) say(last.posts?.[last.posts.length - 1] || '');\n    else { const n = Math.round(pct * 100); say(n < 30 ? 'im mostly air right now. trades fill me' : n < 80 ? `${n}% full. i can feel it` : `${n}%. almost. dont leave`); }\n  }\n\n  // log: lines that arrive while the page is open are typed out one by one\n  const feed = s.feed || [];\n  const fkey = feed.length ? feed[0].at + feed.length : '';\n  if (fkey !== render.fkey) {\n    const first = render.fkey === undefined;\n    render.fkey = fkey;\n    render.lines = render.lines || new Set();\n    const line = (f, typed) => {\n      const m = el('span', { className: 'm ' + (MSG[f.tag] || ''), textContent: typed ? '' : f.m });\n      const li = el('li', {},\n        el('span', { className: 't', textContent: hhmm(f.at) }),\n        el('span', { className: 'tag', textContent: f.tag, style: `color:${TAG[f.tag] || '#9a8f99'};border-color:${TAG[f.tag] || '#9a8f99'}` }), m);\n      const tx = () => { if (f.tag === 'win' && (!f.tx || f.tx === 'dry-run')) m.append(el('span', { className: 'tx dry', textContent: 'tx (test)' })); else if (f.tx) m.append(el('a', { className: 'tx', href: 'https://solscan.io/tx/' + f.tx, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', textContent: 'tx ↗' })); };\n      if (!typed) tx();\n      return { li, m, text: f.m, typed, tx };\n    };\n    const items = [...feed].reverse().map((f) => { const k = f.at + f.m; const isNew = !first && !render.lines.has(k); render.lines.add(k); return line(f, isNew); });\n    const cur = el('li', {}, el('span', { className: 't', textContent: hhmm(new Date().toISOString()) }), el('span'), el('span', { className: 'm cur', textContent: pk ? 'waiting for block ' + pk.targetSlot.toLocaleString('en-US') : mint ? 'waiting for fees' : 'waiting for launch' }));\n    const fresh = items.filter((x) => x.typed);\n    fresh.forEach((x) => (x.li.style.display = 'none'));\n    $('feed').replaceChildren(...items.map((x) => x.li), cur);\n    const down = () => requestAnimationFrame(() => { $('feed').scrollTop = $('feed').scrollHeight; });\n    down();\n    clearTimeout(render.typing);\n    let i = 0;\n    const next = () => {\n      const x = fresh[i++]; if (!x) return;\n      x.li.style.display = ''; down();\n      let n = 0;\n      const step = () => { n += 2; x.m.textContent = x.text.slice(0, n); if (n < x.text.length) render.typing = setTimeout(step, 18); else { x.tx(); down(); render.typing = setTimeout(next, 500); } };\n      step();\n    };\n    next();\n  }\n\n  // opened tape\n  const h = s.history || [];\n  const hkey = h.map((b) => b.boxId).join(',');\n  if (h.length && hkey !== render.hkey) {\n    render.hkey = hkey;\n    const txOf = (b) => b.prize?.sig && b.prize.sig !== 'dry-run'\n      ? el('a', { className: 'tx', href: 'https://solscan.io/tx/' + b.prize.sig, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', textContent: 'tx ↗' })\n      : el('span', { className: 'tx dry', textContent: 'tx (test)' });\n    const items = () => h.slice(0, 20).map((b) => el('span', { className: 'it' }, el('a', { href: '#box-' + b.boxId },\n      cap(b.draw.tier), el('span', { className: 'd', textContent: '#' + b.boxId }), short(b.draw.winner),\n      el('span', { className: 't-' + b.draw.tier, textContent: `${fmt(sol(b.prize?.lamports), 2)} sol of $${b.prize?.symbol || '?'}` }),\n      el('span', { className: 'd', textContent: ago(b.at) })), txOf(b)));\n    $('grid').replaceChildren(el('div', { className: 'run' }, ...items(), ...items()));\n  }\n\n  const dl = $('wallets'); dl.replaceChildren();\n  for (const [k, v] of [['box', p.box], ['team', p.team], ['dev', p.dev]]) if (v) dl.append(el('dt', { textContent: k }), el('dd', {}, el('a', { href: acct(v), target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', textContent: v })));\n}\n\nasync function load() { try { S = await api('/api/state'); render(); } catch { say('cant reach the box right now. try again in a sec'); } }\nload(); setInterval(load, 5_000); setInterval(() => S && S.pending && render(), 1000);\n\n$('check').onsubmit = async (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const a = $('wallet').value.trim(), out = $('answer'); out.classList.add('on');\n  if (!/^[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{32,44}$/.test(a)) { out.textContent = 'thats not a solana wallet'; return; }\n  out.textContent = 'checking…';\n  try {\n    const r = await api('/api/wallet', 'a=' + a);\n    out.replaceChildren();\n    if (r.status === 'in') out.append('youre in. ', el('b', { textContent: Math.round(r.tickets).toLocaleString() + ' tickets' }), ` · ${r.sharePct}% · ${r.multiplier}x`);\n    else if (r.status === 'waiting') out.append('almost. in after ', el('b', { textContent: r.minutesLeft + ' more min' }));\n    else if (r.status === 'excluded') out.append('pool or our wallet. not in the draw');\n    else out.append('not in yet. hold $20+ for 15 min');\n  } catch { out.textContent = 'couldnt check right now'; }\n};\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-open]').forEach((b) => (b.onclick = () => $(b.dataset.open).showModal()));\ndocument.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n  if (e.target.matches('[data-close]')) e.target.closest('dialog').close();\n  if (e.target.tagName === 'DIALOG') e.target.close();\n});\n$('boxSheet').addEventListener('close', () => { if (location.hash.startsWith('#box-')) history.replaceState(null, '', location.pathname + location.search); });\n\nasync function sha256(s) {\n  const b = await crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256', new TextEncoder().encode(s));\n  return [...new Uint8Array(b)].map((x) => x.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('');\n}\nasync function recompute(b) {\n  const list = b.rows.filter((r) => r.tickets > 0).sort((x, y) => (x.owner < y.owner ? -1 : 1));\n  const total = list.reduce((a, r) => a + r.tickets, 0);\n  const seed = await sha256(`${b.draw.blockhash}:${b.boxId}`);\n  const roll = (parseInt(seed.slice(0, 13), 16) / 2 ** 52) * total;\n  let acc = 0, winner = list[list.length - 1]?.owner;\n  for (const r of list) { acc += r.tickets; if (roll < acc) { winner = r.owner; break; } }\n  const n = parseInt(seed.slice(13, 21), 16) % 100;\n  let t = 0, tier = 'common';\n  for (const x of TIERS) { t += x.pct; if (n < t) { tier = x.key; break; } }\n  const seal = b.salt ? await sha256(`${b.plan.common.mint}|${b.plan.rare.mint}|${b.salt}`) : '';\n  return { seed, winner, tier, total, seal };\n}\nasync function openBox(id) {\n  const body = $('boxBody');\n  body.replaceChildren(el('h2', { className: 'px', textContent: 'box #' + id }), el('div', { className: 'muted', textContent: 'loading…' }));\n  $('boxSheet').showModal();\n  let b; try { b = await api('/api/box', 'id=' + id); } catch { b = null; }\n  if (!b || b.error) { body.lastChild.textContent = 'no such box'; return; }\n  const d = b.draw, pr = b.prize || {};\n  const link = (href, text) => el('a', { href, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', textContent: text });\n  const dl = el('dl', {},\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'winner' }), el('dd', {}, link(acct(d.winner), d.winner)),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'pulled' }), el('dd', {}, el('span', { className: 'px t-' + d.tier, textContent: d.tier }), ` ${fmt(sol(pr.lamports))} sol of $${pr.symbol || '?'}`,\n      pr.fromVault && pr.fromVault !== '0' ? ` (${fmt(sol(pr.fromVault))} from the vault)` : '',\n      pr.sig && pr.sig !== 'dry-run' ? el('span', {}, ' · ', link('https://solscan.io/tx/' + pr.sig, 'tx')) : ' (test)'),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'inside' }), el('dd', {}, el('span', { className: 't-common', textContent: '$' + b.plan.common.symbol }), ' and ', el('span', { className: 't-rare', textContent: '$' + b.plan.rare.symbol })),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'seal' }), el('dd', { textContent: b.seal || '-' }),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'box' }), el('dd', { textContent: `${fmt(sol(b.budgetLamports))} sol, ${b.eligible} holders in the draw` }),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'block' }), el('dd', {}, link('https://solscan.io/block/' + d.slot, String(d.slot))),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'blockhash' }), el('dd', { textContent: d.blockhash }),\n    el('dt', { textContent: 'seed' }), el('dd', { textContent: d.seed }));\n  const how = el('pre', { textContent: `seal = sha256(common mint | rare mint | salt)\\nseed = sha256(blockhash:${b.boxId})\\nwinner = weighted pick by tickets, wallets sorted a-z\\ntier = seed[13..21] mod 100 → 50 / 30 / 15 / 5` });\n  const res = el('div', { className: 'muted', textContent: b.rows.length ? '' : 'ticket list for this box isnt stored, cant recompute' });\n  const btn = el('button', { className: 'pbtn px', type: 'button', textContent: 'check it myself', disabled: !b.rows.length });\n  btn.onclick = async () => {\n    res.textContent = 'recomputing…';\n    const r = await recompute(b);\n    const okDraw = r.seed === d.seed && r.winner === d.winner && r.tier === d.tier;\n    const okSeal = !b.salt || r.seal === b.seal;\n    res.replaceChildren(\n      el('div', {}, el('span', { className: okSeal ? 'ok' : 'bad', textContent: okSeal ? 'seal matches. ' : 'seal mismatch. ' }), 'the coins were picked before the block'),\n      el('div', {}, el('span', { className: okDraw ? 'ok' : 'bad', textContent: okDraw ? 'draw matches. ' : 'draw mismatch. ' }), `${b.rows.length} wallets, ${Math.round(r.total).toLocaleString()} tickets → ${short(r.winner)}, ${r.tier}`));\n  };\n  body.replaceChildren(el('h2', { className: 'px' }, 'box #' + b.boxId, el('button', { className: 'x', type: 'button', textContent: 'x', ariaLabel: 'close', onclick: () => $('boxSheet').close() })), dl, how, btn, res);\n}\nfunction route() { const m = location.hash.match(/^#box-(\\d+)$/); if (m) openBox(Number(m[1])); }\nwindow.addEventListener('hashchange', route); route();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n";
